# Forbidden: raw `px` sizes

Do not use CSS / `className` / `style` sizes in `px`. Use rem or Tailwind tokens (`min-w-18`, `p-1.5`, `inset-1`). Prefer the Tailwind scale (`4` = 1rem, `1` = 0.25rem, `2` = 0.5rem). Arbitrary rem only if no token exists.

`getBoundingClientRect` (and similar) may stay as pixel numbers. Design constants must be rem, converted to px from the root font size at use time.

New/touched code only — do not mass-rewrite historical `px`.
